# TextFSM template for `show vlan brief` on Cisco Catalyst 2950 EI.
# Handles port lists that wrap onto continuation lines (Filldown + List).
# Verified: IOS 12.1(22)EA9, WS-C2950G-48-EI.
Value Filldown,Required VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value Filldown NAME (\S+)
Value Filldown STATUS (\S+)
Value List PORTS (\S.*?)

Start
  ^\d+\s+\S+\s+\S+ -> Continue.Record
  ^${VLAN_ID}\s+${NAME}\s+${STATUS}\s{2,}${PORTS}\s*$$
  ^${VLAN_ID}\s+${NAME}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$
  ^\s{2,}${PORTS}\s*$$
